// 1-28: the dark part of the modem.
id l1-28
name 1-28 DEEP FADE
tagline the dark part of the modem.
bg hall
// RULES: what this room is about, how often each mechanic shows up, how hard each portion is (docs/level-design-rules.md)
main neon anchor pull
mechanics current:35 plank:5 pull:7 anchor:8 yank:2 hack:1 neon:9 white:6 secret:2
new -
portion 4 a secret wall 10 wide with packets inside, or climb over it
portion 6.4 neon/white stones nnWWn (3 wide, 3 apart) over current
portion 6.5 drive a rail 8 long, swing a 26 gap (ceiling, high anchors)
portion 6 hop 4 blocks 3 tall and 2 wide over 4-wide current
portion 7.5 hop 5 pull ports (low, mid, ceiling, high, low), 8-8-8-7 apart, over current
portion 5.6 jump 3 current notches, 7 wide, 4 apart
portion 5.1 hack port opens a gate, 5-wide current beyond
portion 5 a 3-tall plateau 11 wide with a current notch on top
portion 6 two pull ports up to the top lane
portion 7.1 drive a rail 12 long, swing a 26 gap (mid, mid anchors)
portion 6.4 hop 5 floating blocks over current (heights 13333)
portion 6.3 neon/white stones nnWW (2 wide, 4 apart) over current
portion 7.2 neon/white stones nnWWnn (2 wide, 3 apart) over current
portion 6.4 zip 4 anchors (mid, mid, high, high), 8-8-8 apart, over current
portion 5.6 hop 5 one-way planks over current (heights 11131)
portion 5.5 a 4-tall plateau 9 wide with a current notch on top
hardness 6
map
